              <div class="space-y-3 my-6 not-prose">
                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-2xs">
                  <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">1. Half-Day Tour: Cu Chi Is The Destination</div>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
