                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Departing early bypasses the worst rush-hour gridlock heading northwest out of District 1.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-2xs">
