                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Walking forested trails, examining camouflaged trapdoors, exploring weapon traps, visiting Hoang Cam smokeless kitchens, seeing how partisans wore the <a href="/khan-ran-nam-bo" class="text-amber-800 hover:text-amber-900 font-semibold underline underline-offset-2 decoration-amber-300">traditional khăn rằn scarf</a>, trying the optional crawl, and tasting wartime boiled cassava.</p>
