                  <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">4. 11:15 AM–01:00 PM — Return Transit to Central Saigon</div>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Heading directly back to your hotel or a recommended downtown restaurant with the afternoon completely open.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <p>
                The half-day format provides a focused visit to the Cu Chi site without committing the entire day.
              </p>

