                A typical sequence looks like:
              </p>
              <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm">
                <li><strong>07:30–08:00 AM:</strong> Hotel pickup in central Saigon.</li>
                <li><strong>08:00–09:45 AM:</strong> Highway transit to Cu Chi (Ben Dinh or Ben Duoc).</li>
                <li><strong>09:45–12:00 PM:</strong> In-depth exploration of the tunnel complex and exhibits.</li>
                <li><strong>12:15–01:30 PM:</strong> Traditional Vietnamese lunch at a riverside restaurant near Cu Chi or back in suburban Saigon.</li>
                <li><strong>01:30–02:30 PM:</strong> Drive back toward District 1.</li>
